# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — Conan copy() 不递归目录 → header-only 包缺 include ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-03
# Software: emio 0.9.0 (task emio-0.9.0-r01-pc1-51)
# Gate: conan-verify G2 (test_package)
# Status: DRAFT — 同 stem 配对 knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-emio-0.9.0-conan-copy-dir-recursion.md

id: DRAFT-emio-0.9.0-conan-copy-dir-recursion
trigger_tool: conan|cmake
phase: package|test_package
error_signature: Imported target.*includes non-existent path.*/p/include|
                  INTERFACE_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES.*does not exist|
                  CMake Generate step failed

severity: 2
category: conan, packaging, headers, header-only
match_keywords: copytree, copy, include, header-only, INTERFACE, package_folder,
                 includedirs, CMakeDeps, imported target, non-existent path, directory, recursion

title: conan.tools.files.copy() 按 glob 文件匹配不递归目录，header-only 包手动拷贝头文件目录需用 shutil.copytree

root_cause: copy(pattern) 以 glob 文件语义展开，指向目录时不递归内部文件，整目录静默不拷贝；
            而 package_info().includedirs 仍导出该 include 路径，CMakeDeps 导入目标引用
            不存在的目录，conan create 在 test_package Generate 阶段失败。

affected_scope: 无上游 CMake install/export、需在 package() 手动安装头文件目录的 header-only 库（Conan 2）

verification_cmd: conan create archives/e/emio/0.9.0 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing --user=ohpcd --channel=stable

rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: shutil-copytree-for-header-dir
rec_command: package() 中对 include/<dir> 用 shutil.copytree(source/include/<dir>, package/include/<dir>)；单文件/glob 文件仍用 copy()
rec_auto_fix: false

fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: cmake-install-path
fallback_description: 上游自带 install/export 时走 CMake install（见 E322），无需手动拷头

forbid_1_pattern: copy\(self, "include/.*" 且期望目录递归
forbid_1_reason: copy() 对目录 pattern 静默不递归，包缺头文件
forbid_2_pattern: includedirs.*include.*但包内无 include 目录
forbid_2_reason: CMakeDeps 导入目标引用不存在的路径

principles: P012, P014